      <div type="layout" source="#source-820-1177" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-855-1139" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <div type="layout" source="#source-902-1095" style="inline-size: 27em">
            <p><seg source="#source-940-1059">――彌生式土器の貝塚？――特種の遺跡――新に又貝塚――樽貝塚――疑問の貝塚――</seg></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1184-1220"><rb>望蜀生</rb><rt>ばうしよくせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1220-1223">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1223-1247"><rb>採集</rb><rt>さいしふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1247-1253">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1253-1268"><rb>歸</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1268-1274">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1274-1286"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1286-1310">た。それは三十六</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1310-1328"><rb>年</rb><rt>ねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1328-1334">十一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1334-1355"><rb>月</rb><rt>ぐわつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1355-1361">三十</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1361-1379"><rb>日</rb><rt>にち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1379-1382">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1382-1406"><rb>夕方</rb><rt>ゆふがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1406-1411">。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1414-1429"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429-1432">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1432-1444"><rb>有</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1444-1458">つたか。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1461-1473"><rb>這</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1473-1485">んなのが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1485-1497"><rb>有</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1497-1512">りましたと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1512-1524"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1524-1530">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1530-1542"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1542-1557">せるのは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1557-1599"><rb>彌生式土器</rb><rt>やよひしきどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1599-1602">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1602-1626"><rb>上部</rb><rt>じやうぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1626-1650">（第五圖參照）と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1650-1671"><rb>破片</rb><rt>はへん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1671-1695"><rb>澤山</rb><rt>たくさん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1695-1710"><rb>及</rb><rt>およ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1710-1713">び</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1713-1725"><rb>木</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1725-1728">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1728-1740"><rb>葉</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1740-1755"><rb>底</rb><rt>ぞこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1755-1767">である。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1767-1782"><rb>別</rb><rt>べつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1782-1785">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1785-1821"><rb>貝塚土器</rb><rt>かひづかどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1821-1824">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1824-1854"><rb>網代底</rb><rt>あじろぞこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1854-1857">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1857-1872"><rb>箇</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872-1877">。</seg></p>
        <p><figure source="#source-1877-1999"><graphic url="fig55729_01.png" width="300px" height="241px"/><note type="caption-reference"><seg source="#source-1886-1916">第五圖（武藏北加瀬）</seg></note></figure></p>
      </div>
      <div type="caption" source="#source-2001-2148">
        <p><seg source="#source-2042-2074">第五圖（武藏北加瀬）</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-2074-2103">（彌生式土器上部）</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>『これは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2164-2179"><rb>君</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2179-2182">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2182-2212"><rb>彌生式</rb><rt>やよひしき</rt></ruby>ぢやアないか』</p>
        <p>『なる<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2244-2259"><rb>程</rb><rt>ほど</rt></ruby><g ref="#gaiji-47-9" source="#source-2259-2293"/>』</p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2301-2322"><rb>破片</rb><rt>はへん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2322-2331">をツギ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2331-2346"><rb>合</rb><rt>あは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2346-2352">せて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2352-2364"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2364-2373">ると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2373-2403"><rb>徳利形</rb><rt>とくりがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2403-2406">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2406-2448"><rb>彌生式土器</rb><rt>やよひしきどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2448-2457">。とは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2457-2469"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2469-2478">らずに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2478-2514"><rb>望蜀生</rb><rt>ばうしよくせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2514-2517">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2517-2553"><rb>貝塚土器</rb><rt>かひづかどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2553-2556">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2556-2571"><rb>信</rb><rt>しん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2571-2577">じて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2577-2589"><rb>掘</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2589-2595">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2595-2607"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2607-2625">たのである。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2625-2646"><rb>場所</rb><rt>ばしよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2646-2649">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2649-2667"><rb>何處</rb><rt>どこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2667-2673">だと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2673-2685"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2685-2694">くと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2694-2730"><rb>神奈川縣</rb><rt>かながはけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2730-2733">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2733-2769"><rb>橘樹郡</rb><rt>たちばなごほり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2769-2772">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2772-2808"><rb>北加瀬村</rb><rt>きたかせむら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2808-2811">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2811-2835"><rb>貝塚</rb><rt>かひづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2835-2840">。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2843-2867"><rb>貝塚</rb><rt>かひづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2867-2873">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2873-2903"><rb>彌生式</rb><rt>やよひしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2903-2906">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2906-2918"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2918-2924">る。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2924-2960"><rb>其分量</rb><rt>そつぶんりやう</rt></ruby><note type="sic" source="#source-2960-3014">ルビの「そつぶんりやう」はママ</note><seg source="#source-3014-3017">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3017-3038"><rb>普通</rb><rt>ふつう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3038-3041">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3041-3077"><rb>貝塚土器</rb><rt>かひづかどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3077-3098">よりも、ずんと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3098-3122"><rb>多量</rb><rt>たりやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3122-3127">。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3130-3154"><rb>貝塚</rb><rt>かひづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3154-3157">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3157-3187"><rb>彌生式</rb><rt>やよひしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3187-3190">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3190-3205"><rb>混</rb><rt>こん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3205-3214">じたと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3214-3226"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3226-3244">はうよりも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3244-3286"><rb>彌生式土器</rb><rt>やよひしきどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3286-3289">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3289-3301"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3301-3304">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3304-3328"><rb>貝塚</rb><rt>かひづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3328-3334">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3334-3346"><rb>他</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3346-3349">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3349-3367"><rb>土器</rb><rt>どき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3367-3370">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3370-3385"><rb>混</rb><rt>こん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3385-3394">じたと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3394-3406"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3406-3415">ひたい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3415-3433"><rb>位</rb><rt>くらゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3433-3436">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3436-3463"><rb>分量</rb><rt>ぶんりやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3463-3477">である。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-3477-3486">いよ</seg><choice source="#source-3486-3492"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3492-3525"><rb>大問題</rb><rt>だいもんだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3525-3528">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3528-3552"><rb>早速</rb><rt>さツそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3552-3555">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3555-3585"><rb>水谷氏</rb><rt>みづたにし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3585-3588">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3588-3606"><rb>處</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3606-3609">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3609-3633"><rb>報告</rb><rt>ほうこく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3633-3645">すると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3645-3657"><rb>氏</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3657-3660">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3660-3675"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3675-3681">いに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3681-3699"><rb>喜</rb><rt>よろこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3699-3708">んで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3708-3732"><rb>早速</rb><rt>さつそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3732-3738">十二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3738-3759"><rb>月</rb><rt>ぐわつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3759-3762">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3762-3774"><rb>入</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3774-3783">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3783-3819"><rb>望蜀生</rb><rt>ばうしよくせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3819-3822">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3822-3837"><rb>共</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3837-3840">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3840-3858"><rb>加瀬</rb><rt>かせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3858-3861">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3861-3873"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3873-3884">つた。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3887-3911"><rb>發掘</rb><rt>はつくつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3911-3914">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3914-3938"><rb>結果</rb><rt>けつくわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3938-3941">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3941-3962"><rb>依然</rb><rt>いぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3962-3971">として</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3971-3995"><rb>多量</rb><rt>たりやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3995-3998">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3998-4055"><rb>彌生式土器破片</rb><rt>やよひしきどきはへん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4055-4058">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4058-4073"><rb>及</rb><rt>およ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4073-4076">び</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4076-4091"><rb>同</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4091-4121"><rb>徳利形</rb><rt>とくりがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4121-4124">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4124-4157"><rb>上半部</rb><rt>じやうはんぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4157-4163">を（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4163-4193"><rb>水谷氏</rb><rt>みづたにし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4193-4199">、二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4199-4214"><rb>箇</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4214-4217">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4217-4253"><rb>望蜀生</rb><rt>ばうしよくせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4253-4259">、三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4259-4274"><rb>箇</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4274-4277">）</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4277-4298"><rb>掘出</rb><rt>ほりだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4298-4309">した。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-4309-4321">それが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4321-4345"><rb>貝層</rb><rt>かひそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4345-4354">の四五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4354-4375"><rb>尺</rb><rt>しやく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4375-4390"><rb>下</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4390-4408">からである。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4408-4423"><rb>曾</rb><rt>かつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4423-4426">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4426-4450"><rb>攪亂</rb><rt>かくらん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4450-4456">せる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4456-4480"><rb>痕跡</rb><rt>こんせき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4480-4483">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4483-4495"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4495-4498">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4498-4531"><rb>貝層中</rb><rt>かひそうちう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4531-4551">からである。</seg></p>
